# Instance user management errors
E16000 = The user details are invalid.
E16007 = The user was not found.
E16008 = This user has changed (current version { $current_version }). Refresh and try again.
E16009 = The expected revision must be a positive whole number.
E16011 = The reason must be at most { $max } characters.
E16012 = The page size must be between 1 and { $max }.
E16013 = Conflicting pagination arguments were supplied.
E16014 = The { $field } filter is invalid.
E16015 = The { $field } date range is invalid or reversed.
E16016 = The page cursor is invalid or does not belong to this search.
E16017 = The selected theme is invalid.
E16018 = The client mutation identifier must be at most { $max } characters.
E16019 = User management storage is temporarily unavailable. No changes were committed.
E16020 = The user's access could not be invalidated. No changes were committed.
